    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15171" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ēdŭcātor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				rearer</i>, <i>bringer - up</i> (rare, but good
			prose). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop., of a
				<i>foster-father</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Planc.
				33, 81</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 7, 1, 14</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 2,
				34</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of <i>tutors</i>, <i>pedagogues</i>, <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 11,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">12, 41</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Dig. 40,
				2, 13</span></i> et saep.</div>
